    "analysis": "# Writeup CTF: Hardware accelerated flag checker 1\n\n- **Kategori:** Hardware / Reverse Engineering\n- **Tingkat Kesulitan:** Medium\n- **Artefak:** `netlist.v`\n- **Flag:** `NNS{qu1ck_and_3ff1ci3n7_check5}`\n\n---\n\n# 1. Deskripsi Tantangan\n\nChallenge memberikan sebuah netlist Verilog hasil sintesis dari sebuah flag checker hardware.\n\nTidak diberikan source code asli, melainkan hasil:\n\n```\nlogic synthesis\n```\n\nNetlist berisi implementasi FSM yang menerima input karakter satu per satu.\n\nModul memiliki:\n\n```\ncharacter[6:0]\n```\n\nsebagai input karakter.\n\nState internal:\n\n```\ns[4:0]\n```\n\ndan output:\n\n```\nfound_flag\n```\n\nTujuan challenge adalah merekonstruksi urutan karakter yang membuat FSM mencapai kondisi:\n\n```\nfound_flag = 1\n```\n\n---\n\n# 2. File Challenge\n\nFile:\n\n```\nnetlist.v\n```\n\nIsi modul:\n\n```verilog\nmodule flag_checker(\n    clk,\n    reset_n,\n    character,\n    found_flag\n);\n```\n\nInterface:\n\n```verilog\nreg [4:0] s;\n\ninput [6:0] character;\n\noutput found_flag;\n```\n\n---\n\n# 3. Analisis Awal\n\nKarena state hanya:\n\n```\n5 bit\n```\n\nmaka jumlah kemungkinan state:\n\n\\[\n2^5=32\n\\]\n\nArtinya FSM hanya memiliki:\n\n```\n32 state\n```\n\nTidak diperlukan brute force seluruh string.\n\nCukup mencari jalur:\n\n```\nstate awal\n\n        |\n\n        v\n\nstate target\n```\n\ndengan transisi karakter.\n\n---\n\n# 4. Analisis Output Flag\n\nBagian output:\n\n```verilog\nassign _227_ = ~(_224_ | _225_);\n\nassign _228_ = ~(s[4] & _227_);\n\nassign found_flag = ~_228_;\n```\n\nSetelah disederhanakan:\n\n\\[\nfound\\_flag =\ns[4]\\land s[3]\\land s[2]\\land s[1]\\land s[0]\n\\]\n\n---\n\nArtinya:\n\n```\nfound_flag = 1\n```\n\nketika:\n\n```\ns = 11111\n```\n\natau:\n\n```\nstate = 31\n```\n\n---\n\n# 5. Analisis State Machine\n\nBagian akhir netlist menunjukkan update state:\n\n```verilog\nalways @(posedge clk)\n\nif (_000_)\n    s[4] <= 1'h0;\n\nelse\n    s[4] <= _289_[4];\n```\n\nPola yang sama berlaku untuk:\n\n```\ns[0]\ns[1]\ns[2]\ns[3]\n```\n\n---\n\nKesimpulan:\n\nSetiap clock:\n\n```\ncurrent state\n\n+\n\ncharacter input\n\n        |\n\n        v\n\nnext state\n```\n\n---\n\n# 6. Pendekatan Solusi\n\nKarena jumlah state hanya:\n\n```\n32\n```\n\nmaka metode paling sederhana:\n\n```\nBreadth First Search (BFS)\n```\n\npada graph FSM.\n\nSetiap node:\n\n```\nstate\n```\n\nSetiap edge:\n\n```\nkarakter ASCII\n```\n\n---\n\nAlgoritma:\n\n1. Mulai dari:\n\n```\nstate = 0\n```\n\n2. Coba seluruh karakter printable:\n\n```\nASCII 32 - 126\n```\n\n3. Hitung next state.\n\n4. Simpan path karakter.\n\n5. Berhenti ketika:\n\n```\nstate = 31\n```\n\n---\n\n# 7. Parsing Netlist\n\nSolver membaca seluruh statement:\n\n```verilog\nassign\n```\n\nContoh:\n\n```verilog\nassign _123_ = ~(s[0] & character[2]);\n```\n\nKemudian diterjemahkan menjadi ekspresi Python.\n\nOperator Verilog:\n\n| Verilog | Python |\n|-|-|\n| `~` | `not` |\n| `&` | `and` |\n| `|` | `or` |\n\n---\n\n# 8. Simulasi FSM\n\nUntuk setiap karakter:\n\nState:\n\n```python\ns = [\n    bit0,\n    bit1,\n    bit2,\n    bit3,\n    bit4\n]\n```\n\nCharacter:\n\n```python\ncharacter = [\n    bit0,\n    bit1,\n    ...\n    bit6\n]\n```\n\nKemudian semua assign dievaluasi.\n\nOutput:\n\n```\nnext state\n```\n\ndihitung dari:\n\n```\n_289_[0..4]\n```\n\n---\n\n# 9. Recovery Flag\n\nPath hasil BFS:\n\n```\nNNS{qu1ck_and_3ff1ci3n7_check5}\n```\n\nSetiap karakter merupakan transisi valid FSM.\n\n---\n\n# 10. Solve Script\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\nimport re\nfrom collections import deque\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\nNETLIST = Path(\"netlist.v\")\n\nTARGET_STATE = 31\n\nPRINTABLE = range(32,127)\n\n\ndef load_assigns(path):\n\n    text = path.read_text()\n\n    assigns = []\n\n    for m in re.finditer(\n        r\"assign\\s+([^=]+?)\\s*=\\s*(.*?);\",\n        text\n    ):\n\n        lhs = m.group(1).strip()\n\n        rhs = m.group(2).strip()\n\n        rhs = (\n            rhs\n            .replace(\"~\",\" not \")\n            .replace(\"&\",\" and \")\n            .replace(\"|\",\" or \")\n        )\n\n        assigns.append(\n            (lhs,rhs)\n        )\n\n    return assigns\n\n\nASSIGNS = load_assigns(\n    NETLIST\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n# 11. Fungsi Transisi FSM\n\n```python\ndef step(state,ch):\n\n    s = [\n        bool((state >> i)&1)\n        for i in range(5)\n    ]\n\n    character = [\n        bool((ch >> i)&1)\n        for i in range(7)\n    ]\n\n    env = {\n        \"s\":s,\n        \"character\":character,\n        \"reset_n\":True\n    }\n\n    values = {}\n\n    for lhs,rhs in ASSIGNS:\n\n        values[lhs] = bool(\n            eval(\n                rhs,\n                {\"__builtins__\":{}},\n                env\n            )\n        )\n\n        if \"[\" not in lhs:\n            env[lhs] = values[lhs]\n\n\n    if values.get(\"_000_\",False):\n\n        return 0\n\n\n    return sum(\n        1<<i\n        for i in range(5)\n        if values.get(\n            f\"_289_[{i}]\",\n            False\n        )\n    )\n```\n\n---\n\n# 12. BFS Recovery\n\n```python\ndef recover_flag():\n\n    queue = deque(\n        [\n            (0,\"\")\n        ]\n    )\n\n    seen = {0}\n\n\n    while queue:\n\n        state,prefix = queue.popleft()\n\n\n        if state == TARGET_STATE:\n\n            return prefix\n\n\n        for ch in PRINTABLE:\n\n            nxt = step(\n                state,\n                ch\n            )\n\n            if nxt not in seen:\n\n                seen.add(nxt)\n\n                queue.append(\n                    (\n                        nxt,\n                        prefix+chr(ch)\n                    )\n                )\n\n\n    raise Exception(\n        \"target unreachable\"\n    )\n```\n\n---\n\n# 13. Cara Menjalankan\n\nJalankan:\n\n```bash\npython3 solve.py\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```text\n<FLAG>NNS{qu1ck_and_3ff1ci3n7_check5}</FLAG>\n```\n\n---\n\n# 14. Kesimpulan\n\nChallenge ini merupakan reverse engineering terhadap hardware logic hasil sintesis.\n\nTidak diperlukan:\n\n- brute force flag;\n- simulasi FPGA;\n- analisis timing.\n\nKarena state FSM hanya:\n\n```\n5 bit\n```\n\nmaka cukup dilakukan:\n\n```\nParse netlist\n\n        |\n\n        v\n\nRekonstruksi FSM\n\n        |\n\n        v\n\nBFS dari state 0\n\n        |\n\n        v\n\nCari state 31\n\n        |\n\n        v\n\nDapatkan flag\n```\n\nFlag berhasil diperoleh:\n\n```\nNNS{qu1ck_and_3ff1ci3n7_check5}\n```",
