    "analysis": "Tantangan ini memberikan berkas firmware `harald-blatann.hex` (Intel HEX format) untuk mikroprosesor ARM Cortex (Nordic Semiconductor nRF Connect SDK / Zephyr OS).\n\n### 1. Ekstraksi Firmware\nFirmware Intel HEX berisi memory address range:\n- `0x01000000` - `0x01026a58`\n- `0x01026a60` - `0x01028b6c`\nStart address berada di `0x01013065` (ARM Thumb mode).\n\n### 2. Analisis BLE GATT & Callback Write\nTerdapat custom BLE service GATT:\n- Service UUID: `12345678-1234-5678-1234-56789abcdef0`\n- Characteristic Write Callback mengarah ke address `0x01011b14`.\n\nAlur kerja fungsi callback:\n```\nInput BLE Write -> Import AES Key -> PSA Cipher Decrypt -> Compare Plaintext -> Result\n```\n\n### 3. PSA Crypto Decryption & Offset Kunci\nCallback memanggil `psa_cipher_decrypt()`:\n- **Ciphertext Blob**: `0x01028103` (Panjang: `0x60` / 96 byte)\n- **AES Key**: `0x01028163` (Panjang: `0x20` / 32 byte -> AES-256)\n- **IV**: 16 byte pertama dari ciphertext blob.\n- **Mode**: AES-256-CBC.\n\n### 4. Dekripsi Plaintext\nPlaintext didekripsi dari `ciphertext[16:]` menggunakan AES-256-CBC dengan IV = `ciphertext[:16]` dan key dari firmware. Plaintext yang dihasilkan memuat flag CTF sepanjang 61 byte.",
